●
receipt of marketing approvals from the FDA and other regulatory authorities for our current and future product candidates, including pricing approvals where required;
●
establishing and maintaining commercial manufacturing capabilities or making arrangements with third-party manufacturers;
●
obtaining and maintaining patent and trade secret protection and regulatory exclusivity for our product candidates;
